      "widgets_values": [
        "A cinematic, sun-drenched portrait of a blonde 22 y/o woman leaning casually against a classic red convertible parked near a beachside promenade. The setting evokes a warm California summer afternoon, with soft golden-hour light creating a nostalgic glow across her skin and hair. Palm trees stand tall and slightly out of focus in the background, giving a dreamy, vintage coastal ambiance.\n\nThe woman wears a fitted white crop-top with red trim around the sleeves and collar, decorated with a small colorful retro graphic across the chest. She pairs it with high-waisted athletic shorts in bright red with yellow piping, giving the outfit a 1970s–early-80s sporty aesthetic. Her blonde hair is voluminous, slightly tousled, and glowing from the sun, enhancing the retro Americana vibe.\n\nThe visual style is soft, filmic, and warm—shot with shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, and a subtle grain emulating Kodak Portra or vintage 35mm film. Colors are vibrant yet natural, dominated by reds, yellows, and sun-washed neutrals. Composition focuses on the model from the waist up, framed at a slight angle to show both her pose and the car’s interior. Mood is playful, nostalgic, and effortlessly confident."
      ]
